    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1017">

                <pb facs="1129" n="1033" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1033"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-18"><hi rendition="#italic">February 18,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 148.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    this morning of telegraphic dispatch from the Department.</p>
                <p>As instructed, I have at once addressed an official note to the Spanish <pb
                        facs="1130" n="1034" xml:id="pg1034"/> minister of foreign affairs,
                    conveying to his excellency the deep appreciation which the President, the
                    Government, and the people of the United States feel for this generous tribute
                    to the memory of our dead and for this manifestation of sympathy in our
                    grief.</p>
                <p>I will present this note to the Spanish minister in person this afternoon, and
                    will also call personally upon Señor Sagasta, the president of the council of
                    ministers.</p>
                <p>I inclose copy of my note to the Spanish minister, and am, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stewart L. Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1017-a1.xml" xpointer="d1017-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
